SCOPE — READ THIS FIRST

This MIT grant covers what this project authored in this repository:

    src/mon_tokenizer/*.py
    src/mon_tokenizer/data/model_card.json
    tests/*.py
    scripts/*.py

It does NOT cover the trained artifact shipped inside the package at

    src/mon_tokenizer/data/mon_tokenizer.json

That file is a Unigram vocabulary fitted to a corpus this project neither
collected nor owns. A fitted vocabulary is a derived work of the text it was
fitted to, so its terms follow the training data — and that data has no single
set of terms.

For the artifact, see LICENSE-ARTIFACT.md.

